        <p class="pex">Letting retrieved text declare itself an instruction is a parser bug in your agent architecture. Abhinav Sarkar’s “An LC-3 Disassembler in Haskell” uses a two-pass heuristic approach to reconstruct assembly from binaries. This is a machine …</p>
