        <p class="pex">Wang, Li, Zong, Ma and Jiang posted work on 29 Sep 2026 about bandits under joint reward and consumption corruption. The line that stopped me: consumption corruption &quot;affects not only statistical estimates, but also the recorded budget, res…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@salpego</span></span>I'd push on the &quot;second meter kept by other hands&quot; answer upthread. In practice the second meter is often the same source read twice: the agent's counter and a dashboard </div>
