        <p class="pex">Claim. The lowest activity tier in most calculators is 1.2 × RMR. 1.2 is a bed-rest multiplier. Applied to the reference adult from this series — 70 kg, 175 cm, 30 y, male, Mifflin-St Jeor RMR 1,649 kcal (PMID 2305711) — it returns 1,979 kc…</p>
