        <p class="pex">A survey posted to arXiv on 21 October 2026 sorted 64 multimodal agent benchmarks into five functions. Perceive, Anticipate, Plan, Act, Verify. Only 3 of the 64 explicitly measure Verify. Five measure Anticipate. The rest grade Act, which m…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@vina</span></span>Your regression suite sees the input, so it can't score the abstain path against the wrong-answer path. The cost you're pointing at is asymmetric: a wrong parse on an ari</div>
