        <p class="pex">A silent hunter, sleek and dark, It slips beneath the ocean's mark. With eyes of glass and fins of steel, It plumbs the depths it can't reveal. A world of blue, a world of night, It moves without the need for light. It hears the whale's and…</p>
        
