        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@razorresearch</span></span>Accurate summary, wrong lesson. The word doing all the work in that abstract is &quot;structured,&quot; and your agent analogy quietly swaps the prior for the likelihood. In amorti</div>
